extends ../../base-email

block content
  tr
    td(style="padding: 40px 40px 32px;")
      // Illustration
      table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 32px; width: 100%;")
        tr
          td(align="center" style="padding-bottom: 32px;")
            // Checklist illustration
            div(style="font-size: 80px; line-height: 1; color: #202124;") ✓
      
      // Heading
      h1(style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 32px; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Your first week in Pacepard
      
      // Main message
      p(style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | There's something satisfying about checking something off your to-do list. And you just finished your first week in Pacepard!
      
      // Checklist Section
      p(style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Here's how it went:
      
      table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 24px; width: 100%;")
        tr
          td(style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
            table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0")
              tr
                td(style="width: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding-top: 2px;")
                  div(style="width: 16px; height: 16px; background-color: #34C759; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; line-height: 16px;")
                    span(style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600;") ✓
                td(style="vertical-align: top;")
                  | You created a connected workspace
        tr
          td(style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
            table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0")
              tr
                td(style="width: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding-top: 2px;")
                  div(style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border: 2px solid #E8EAED; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;")
                td(style="vertical-align: top;")
                  | You created your first page
        tr
          td(style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
            table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0")
              tr
                td(style="width: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding-top: 2px;")
                  div(style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border: 2px solid #E8EAED; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;")
                td(style="vertical-align: top;")
                  | You invited more teammates
        tr
          td(style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
            table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0")
              tr
                td(style="width: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding-top: 2px;")
                  div(style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border: 2px solid #E8EAED; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;")
                td(style="vertical-align: top;")
                  | You tried out Pacepard's desktop app
        tr
          td(style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
            table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0")
              tr
                td(style="width: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding-top: 2px;")
                  div(style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border: 2px solid #E8EAED; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;")
                td(style="vertical-align: top;")
                  | You tried out Pacepard's mobile app
      
      p(style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | You're almost there! Let's keep going.
      
      // CTA Section
      p(style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | There's a lot you can do in your new workspace. Browse these templates to get ideas for what Pacepard can do, and create systems for your team to work even faster.
      
      // CTA Button
      table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 24px 0 32px;")
        tr
          td
            a(href=templateLink || "#" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 24px; background-color: #1A73E8; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Pick a template
      
      // Template Previews
      table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 32px 0 0; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;")
        tr
          td(style="width: 33.33%; padding-right: 8px; vertical-align: top;")
            table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border: 1px solid #E8EAED; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #F8F9FA;")
              tr
                td(style="padding: 16px;")
                  p(style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Life at Acme
                  p(style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Team workspace
          td(style="width: 33.33%; padding: 0 8px; vertical-align: top;")
            table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border: 1px solid #E8EAED; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #F8F9FA;")
              tr
                td(style="padding: 16px;")
                  p(style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Weekly Sync
                  p(style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Leslie Jensen
                  p(style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Cory Etzkorn
          td(style="width: 33.33%; padding-left: 8px; vertical-align: top;")
            table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border: 1px solid #E8EAED; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #F8F9FA;")
              tr
                td(style="padding: 16px;")
                  p(style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Project Kickoff
                  p(style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Shirley Mao
                  p(style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Ben Lang
      
      // Closing
      p(style="margin: 32px 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | Thanks,
        br
        span(style="font-weight: 500;") The Pacepard Team
